<main id="content">
  <header class="topbar"><div class="topbar-location"><button id="navigation-toggle" class="button mobile-menu" aria-label="Open navigation" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="guild-navigation" type="button">☰ <span>Menu</span></button><span class="breadcrumb">The guild ledger <span aria-hidden="true">/</span> <strong id="page-breadcrumb">The noticeboard</strong></span></div><div class="account-controls"><button class="theme-toggle" type="button" data-theme-toggle aria-label="Dark mode" aria-pressed="false" title="Toggle dark mode" hidden><span aria-hidden="true">☾</span><span aria-hidden="true">☀</span></button><span class="live-state" id="connection">Checking connection…</span><a id="sign-in" class="button battlenet" href="/auth/login">Sign in with Battle.net</a><button id="sign-out" class="button secondary" hidden>Sign out</button></div></header>
  <section class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow gold" id="page-eyebrow">PULL UP A CHAIR</div><h1 id="page-title">The guild noticeboard</h1><p id="page-subtitle">Good company, useful crafts, and the next grand misadventure.</p></div><img id="page-crest" class="page-crest" src="{{LOGO}}" width="120" height="120" alt=""></section>
  <details class="freshness-summary"><summary><span class="freshness-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="freshness-labels"><strong id="last-refresh">Checking saved WoW observations…</strong><span id="visible-data-age"></span></span><span class="freshness-toggle">Refresh details <span aria-hidden="true">⌄</span></span></summary><div class="freshness-detail"><span id="refresh-timing"></span><span id="profession-freshness"></span><p>Blizzard snapshots can lag behind play. Refresh times show successful checks, not live online status.</p></div></details>
  <div id="notice" class="notice" role="status" aria-live="polite">Connecting to the guild ledger…</div>

<section id="overview" class="tab-panel">
    <section class="stats" aria-label="Guild summary">
    <article><span class="eyebrow">GUILD CHARACTERS</span><strong id="stat-members">—</strong><span id="stat-members-note">Awaiting first import</span></article>
    <article><span class="eyebrow">CLASSES REPRESENTED</span><strong id="stat-classes">—</strong><span>Every adventurer has a place</span></article>
    <article><span class="eyebrow">PROFESSIONS REPORTED</span><strong id="stat-professions">—</strong><span id="stat-professions-note">From character profiles</span></article>
    <article><span class="eyebrow">RECIPES OBSERVED</span><strong id="stat-recipes">—</strong><span>Learned recipes returned by Blizzard</span></article>
  </section>
  <div class="noticeboard-grid">
    <article class="panel guild-company"><div class="board-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow gold">THE COMPANY WE KEEP</span><h2>Your fellow adventurers</h2></div><button class="text-button" data-route="roster">Full roster <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#i-arrow"></use></svg></button></div><div id="overview-members" class="company-list"><p class="subtle">The company will appear after the first successful roster check.</p></div><p class="board-footnote">Characters and levels returned by Blizzard. Choose a character to open their ledger.</p></article>
    <article class="panel board-adventure"><span class="eyebrow gold">GATHER YOUR PARTY</span><h2>The next adventure</h2><div id="overview-events"><p>Sign in to see guild events and claim your place in the party.</p></div><button class="button primary" data-route="events">Visit the event board <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#i-arrow"></use></svg></button></article>
    <article class="panel board-workbench"><div class="board-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow gold">MADE BY THE GUILD</span><h2>At the workbench</h2></div><button class="text-button" data-route="crafting">Crafting board <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#i-arrow"></use></svg></button></div><div id="overview-crafts"><p class="subtle">Sign in to see what the guild is making and who needs a hand.</p></div><div class="board-links"><button class="button" data-route="recipes">Find a recipe</button><button class="button" data-route="professions">Find a profession</button></div></article>
    <article class="panel board-characters"><span class="eyebrow gold">ONE PLAYER, MANY STORIES</span><h2>A place for your whole party.</h2><p>Choose your main, bring your alts together, and let the guild know the character behind the name.</p><button class="text-button" data-route="members">Your main &amp; alts <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#i-arrow"></use></svg></button><span class="tavern-seal" aria-hidden="true">WV</span></article>
  </div>
</section>
  <section id="roster" class="tab-panel" hidden>
    <div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow gold">THE COMPANY WE KEEP</div><h2>The character ledger</h2></div><div class="roster-actions"><button id="group-roster" class="button secondary" disabled>Combine main / alts</button><button id="export" class="button secondary" disabled>↓ Export roster</button></div></div>
    <p id="grouping-note" class="subtle"></p><div class="roster-role-key" aria-label="Role symbols"><span class="subtle">Roles</span><span data-role="Tank"><svg class="role-symbol" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#i-role-tank"></use></svg>Tank</span><span data-role="Healer"><svg class="role-symbol" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#i-role-healer"></use></svg>Healer</span><span data-role="Damage"><svg class="role-symbol" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#i-role-damage"></use></svg>Damage</span><span><span class="role-primary-key" aria-hidden="true">★</span>Primary role</span></div><div class="roster-layout"><div class="panel roster-panel"><div class="filters"><label class="search"><span aria-hidden="true">⌕</span><input id="roster-search" type="search" placeholder="Find a guild member…" aria-label="Search guild members"></label><select id="class-filter" aria-label="Filter by class"><option value="">All classes</option></select><select id="role-filter" aria-label="Filter by role" title="Includes primary and additional roles"><option value="">All roles</option><option value="Tank">Tank</option><option value="Healer">Healer</option><option value="Damage">Damage</option></select><select id="sort" aria-label="Sort guild members"><option value="name">Name A–Z</option><option value="level">Highest level</option><option value="rank">Guild rank</option></select></div><div class="table-wrap"><table aria-label="Guild character roster"><thead><tr><th>CHARACTER</th><th>CLASS</th><th>LEVEL</th><th>GUILD RANK</th><th>PROFESSIONS</th><th>PROFILE</th></tr></thead><tbody id="roster-body"></tbody></table></div><div id="roster-empty" class="empty"><div class="empty-symbol">♜</div><h3>The next chapter starts here.</h3><p>Your roster will appear after the first successful Blizzard import.</p></div><div class="panel-footer"><span id="roster-count">No verified roster yet</span><span>Click a character to explore their skills ↗</span></div></div>
    <div class="composition-panels"><aside class="panel composition" aria-labelledby="class-composition-title"><div class="eyebrow gold">A BALANCED COMPANY</div><h3 id="class-composition-title">Class composition</h3><div id="composition" class="composition-list"><p class="muted">Class distribution appears with your roster.</p></div><div class="composition-note">Counts reflect the returned roster. Combat roles are not inferred from class or talent points.</div></aside>
    <aside class="panel composition" aria-labelledby="profession-composition-title"><div class="eyebrow gold">SKILLED HANDS</div><h3 id="profession-composition-title">Profession composition</h3><div id="profession-composition" class="composition-list"><p class="muted">Profession distribution appears as character profiles are imported.</p></div><div id="profession-composition-note" class="composition-note">Unavailable profiles do not mean a character has no professions.</div></aside>
    <aside class="panel composition" aria-labelledby="role-composition-title"><div class="eyebrow gold">FIND YOUR PARTY</div><h3 id="role-composition-title">Role composition</h3><div id="role-composition" class="composition-list"><p class="muted">Members can share their preferred roles in Members &amp; alts.</p></div><div id="role-composition-note" class="composition-note">Primary role preferences are chosen by members.</div><button class="text-button" data-route="members">Set your character roles →</button></aside></div></div>
  </section>
  <section id="professions" class="tab-panel" hidden><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow gold">SKILLED HANDS, SHARED POSSIBILITIES</div><h2>Guild professions</h2></div><span class="subtle">Primary &amp; secondary skills</span></div><div class="filters panel"><label class="search"><span aria-hidden="true">⌕</span><input id="profession-search" type="search" placeholder="Search profession or member…" aria-label="Search professions"></label></div><p class="subtle">Skill levels appear only when returned. Unavailable profiles do not mean a member has no professions.</p><div id="profession-grid" class="profession-grid"></div><div id="profession-empty" class="empty panel"><div class="empty-symbol">⚒</div><h3>Find the right pair of hands.</h3><p>Profession skill levels will appear as character profiles are imported.</p></div></section>
  <section id="recipes" class="tab-panel" hidden><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow gold">FROM THE GUILD WORKBENCH</div><h2>Who can make it?</h2></div><span class="subtle">Search the guild’s observed recipes</span></div><div class="filters panel"><label class="search"><span aria-hidden="true">⌕</span><input id="recipe-search" type="search" placeholder="Search a recipe, profession, or crafter…" aria-label="Search known recipes"></label><select id="recipe-profession" aria-label="Filter recipes by profession"><option value="">All professions</option></select></div><p class="subtle">A listed crafter has that recipe in Blizzard’s returned list of learned recipes. Missing recipes and unreported lists have unknown coverage.</p><div id="recipe-results" class="recipe-grid"></div><div id="recipe-empty" class="empty panel"><div class="empty-symbol">▤</div><h3>A recipe book written together.</h3><p>No learned recipes have been observed yet. This does not establish that nobody knows them.</p></div><button id="more-recipes" class="button secondary" hidden>Show more recipes</button></section>
  <section id="hierarchy" class="tab-panel" hidden><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow gold">OUR COMPANY, IN ORDER</div><h2>Guild hierarchy</h2></div></div><p class="subtle">Members are ordered by their in-game guild rank. Each player is represented by their highest-ranked guild character; ties use the highest level. Rank names are suggested guild labels and can be edited by the administrator.</p><p id="hierarchy-feedback" class="notice" hidden></p><div id="hierarchy-content"></div></section>
  <section id="gallery" class="tab-panel" hidden><div id="gallery-content"></div></section>
  <section id="account" class="tab-panel" hidden><div id="account-content"></div></section>
  <section id="admin" class="tab-panel" hidden>
    <nav class="admin-section-nav" aria-label="Administration sections">
      <a href="#admin" data-route="admin" data-admin-section="admin">Overview</a>
      <a href="#admin-accounts" data-route="admin-accounts" data-admin-section="admin-accounts">Accounts &amp; sign-ins</a>
      <a href="#admin-data" data-route="admin-data" data-admin-section="admin-data">Data &amp; connections</a>
    </nav>
    <div id="admin-content"></div>
    <section id="status" class="admin-data" hidden><div class="section-heading"><div><h2>Data &amp; connections</h2></div><div class="refresh-actions"><button id="reload" class="button secondary">↻ Refresh display</button><button id="refresh-wow" class="button primary" type="button" hidden disabled>↻ Refresh WoW data</button></div></div><p id="refresh-wow-feedback" class="refresh-feedback subtle" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></p><div class="status-grid"><article class="panel status-card"><h3>Blizzard connection</h3><dl id="sync-details"></dl><p class="subtle">Credentials live in Cloudflare’s server-side secrets. This dashboard never receives or displays them.</p></article><article class="panel status-card"><h3>Coverage &amp; limitations</h3><ul id="limits"></ul><a href="https://github.com/Pinta365/blizzard_api/tree/main/src/wow_forever" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Read the client author’s API reference ↗</a><p class="subtle">HTTP success verifies an observed response, not official API support or complete coverage.</p></article></div><details class="settings-disclosure"><summary>Discord bot settings <span>Application, server and delivery checks</span></summary><article class="panel hall-form"><h3>Discord bot setup · administrator</h3><p id="discord-admin-status" class="subtle"></p><form id="discord-config-form"><div class="form-pair"><label>Application ID<input name="client_id" inputmode="numeric" pattern="[0-9]{15,22}" required></label><label>Server ID<input name="guild_id" inputmode="numeric" pattern="[0-9]{15,22}" required></label></div><label>Events channel ID<input name="events_channel_id" inputmode="numeric" pattern="[0-9]{15,22}" aria-describedby="events-channel-help"></label><p id="events-channel-help" class="subtle">Use your existing #events text channel. {{BOT_NAME}} needs permission to view it, send messages, read message history and add reactions. Check the connection after saving.</p><label>Craft requests channel ID<input name="craft_requests_channel_id" inputmode="numeric" pattern="[0-9]{15,22}" aria-describedby="craft-channel-help"></label><p id="craft-channel-help" class="subtle">Choose a guild text channel for open craft requests and crafter DM fallbacks. {{BOT_NAME}} needs permission to view it, send messages, read message history and add reactions. Each request gets one channel post when no crafter is selected or a selected crafter cannot receive a DM. React ✅ after delivery; the post is removed after completion or cancellation.</p><button class="button primary" type="submit">Save bot details</button></form><p class="subtle">Add DISCORD_BOT_TOKEN and DISCORD_CLIENT_SECRET in Cloudflare’s encrypted Worker secrets. Register <code>{{SITE_ORIGIN}}/auth/discord/callback</code> as the Discord OAuth2 redirect.</p><button id="discord-check" class="button" type="button">Check bot connection</button><div id="discord-verification" class="subtle" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div><a id="discord-invite" class="button" hidden target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Add bot to this server</a><p id="discord-queue" class="subtle"></p></article></details>
<article id="character-mappings-panel" class="panel hall-form character-mappings" hidden>
  <div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow gold">ADMINISTRATOR</span><h3>Discord character mappings</h3></div><button id="character-mappings-refresh" class="button secondary" type="button">Refresh mappings</button></div>
  <p class="subtle">Match a Discord user to a current guild character for event role reactions and crafting requests. Website access still requires Battle.net verification.</p>
  <p id="character-mappings-note" class="subtle"></p>
  <div id="character-mappings-feedback" class="notice" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></div>
  <form id="character-mapping-form">
    <h4 id="character-mapping-form-title">Add or update a mapping</h4>
    <div class="form-pair"><label>Guild character<select name="character_id" required><option value="">Choose a guild character</option></select></label><label>Discord user ID or mention<input name="discord_id" type="text" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" maxlength="30" placeholder="123456789012345678 or &lt;@123456789012345678&gt;" aria-describedby="character-mapping-id-help" required></label></div>
    <p id="character-mapping-id-help" class="subtle">Paste the exact Discord user ID or a user mention such as &lt;@123456789012345678&gt;. Several characters can share one Discord user.</p>
    <label class="alt-choice mapping-consent"><input name="preferred" type="checkbox" checked><span>Default character for Discord events<small>Only one character per Discord user can be the default.</small></span></label>
    <label class="alt-choice mapping-consent"><input name="crafter_dm" type="checkbox"><span>Member agreed to crafting DMs<small>Enable only with the member’s permission. Their own notification preference takes precedence.</small></span></label>
    <div class="mapping-form-actions"><button class="button primary" type="submit" disabled>Save mapping</button><button id="character-mapping-reset" class="button secondary" type="button">Clear form</button></div>
  </form>
  <div id="character-mappings-list" class="mapping-list"></div>
</article>
<details class="settings-disclosure"><summary>API response history <span>Connection evidence and lookup details</span></summary><div class="panel"><div class="panel-title"><h3>Observed API responses</h3><span class="subtle">Latest 150 endpoints</span></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>ENDPOINT</th><th>LATEST RESULT</th><th>LAST SUCCESS</th><th>DETAIL</th></tr></thead><tbody id="evidence-body"></tbody></table></div><div id="evidence-empty" class="empty small"><p>No authenticated API responses have been observed yet.</p></div></div></details></section>
  </section>
  <section id="hall" class="tab-panel" hidden>
    <div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow gold">BETTER ADVENTURES, TOGETHER</div><h2 id="hall-heading">The guild hall</h2></div><span class="subtle">A space for verified guild members</span></div>
    <div id="hall-feedback" class="notice" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></div>
    <div id="hall-gate" class="panel empty"><div class="empty-symbol">⌂</div><h3>Your place in the company.</h3><p id="hall-gate-message">Sign in with Battle.net to use crafting requests, wishlists, events and member profiles. Your guild characters are verified automatically.</p><a class="button battlenet gate-login" href="/auth/login">Sign in with Battle.net</a><p class="privacy-note">Blizzard handles your login. We save only matching guild characters, not your BattleTag or other characters. <a href="/privacy.html">About your data</a></p></div>
    <div id="hall-member" hidden>
      <div class="hall-welcome"><span id="hall-welcome"></span><span class="badge">BATTLE.NET VERIFIED</span></div>
      <div class="hall-tabs" role="group" aria-label="Guild hall sections"><button class="button active" data-hall="craft">Crafting requests</button><button class="button" data-hall="learn">Recipe wishlists</button><button class="button" data-hall="events">Events</button><button class="button" data-hall="people">Members &amp; roleplay</button></div>
      <div id="hall-craft" class="hall-pane">
        <div class="hall-layout"><div><div class="section-heading"><h3>At the guild workbench</h3><select id="craft-status" aria-label="Filter crafting requests"><option value="active">Open &amp; claimed</option><option value="all">All requests</option></select></div><div id="craft-list" class="hall-list"></div></div>
        <details class="composer" id="craft-composer"><summary><span>Request a craft</span><span class="composer-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><form id="craft-form" class="panel hall-form"><h3>Request a craft</h3><label>For character<select name="character_id" class="owned-characters" required></select></label><label>Item or recipe<input name="item_name" list="known-recipes" maxlength="100" minlength="3" placeholder="Search a known recipe or enter an item" required></label><fieldset id="crafter-picker"><legend>Who would you like to ask?</legend><div id="craft-crafters"><p class="subtle">Choose a known recipe to see its crafters.</p></div><p class="subtle">Choose up to 10 crafters. Only selected members who opted in receive DMs. When a craft requests channel is configured, {{BOT_NAME}} posts one request there if you select nobody or a selected crafter cannot receive a DM.</p></fieldset><div class="form-pair"><label>Quantity<input name="quantity" type="number" min="1" max="200" value="1" required></label><label>Materials<select name="materials"><option value="discuss">Discuss with crafter</option><option value="provided">I can provide them</option><option value="need_help">I need help gathering</option></select></label></div><label>Notes<textarea name="notes" maxlength="600" rows="3" placeholder="Anything the crafter should know"></textarea></label><button class="button primary" type="submit">Post request</button><p class="subtle">Choose whom to ask using observed recipes. Other guild members can still volunteer to help; selecting a crafter does not reserve or auto-claim the request.</p></form></details></div>
      </div>
      <div id="hall-learn" class="hall-pane" hidden><div class="hall-layout"><div><h3>The recipes we’re looking for</h3><div id="learn-list" class="hall-list"></div></div><details class="composer" id="learn-composer"><summary><span>Add a recipe wishlist</span><span class="composer-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><form id="learn-form" class="panel hall-form"><h3>Add to your wishlist</h3><label>For character<select name="character_id" class="owned-characters" required></select></label><label>Recipe to learn<input name="item_name" list="known-recipes" minlength="3" maxlength="100" required></label><label>Notes<textarea name="notes" rows="3" maxlength="600" placeholder="Where it drops, or how others can help"></textarea></label><button class="button primary" type="submit">Add recipe</button><p class="subtle">A wishlist is a member’s request, not a claim that Blizzard’s recipe catalog is complete.</p></form></details></div></div>
      <div id="hall-events" class="hall-pane" hidden><div class="hall-layout"><section aria-labelledby="active-events-heading"><h3 id="active-events-heading" class="event-board-heading">Active events</h3><p class="subtle">Choose a role here or on the Discord announcement. Only confirmed sign-ups count towards the party.</p><div id="event-list" class="hall-list"></div></section><details class="composer" id="event-composer"><summary><span>Plan an event</span><span class="composer-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><form id="event-form" class="panel hall-form"><h3>Plan an event</h3><label>Host character<select name="character_id" class="owned-characters" required></select></label><label>Event name<input name="title" minlength="3" maxlength="100" placeholder="An evening in the Deadmines" required></label><div class="form-pair"><label>Type<select name="kind"><option>Dungeon</option><option>Raid</option><option>Roleplay</option><option>Other</option></select></label><label>Places<input name="capacity" type="number" min="1" max="40" value="5" required></label></div><div id="event-template-options"></div><label>Starts at · your local time<input name="starts_at" type="datetime-local" required></label><label>Duration · minutes<input name="duration_minutes" type="number" min="15" max="720" value="120" required></label><label>Meeting place<input name="location" maxlength="100"></label><label>Details<textarea name="description" maxlength="1000" rows="3"></textarea></label><p id="discord-event-note" class="subtle"></p><button class="button primary" type="submit">Create event</button><p class="subtle">Members choose roles on the website or by reacting to the Discord announcement. Suggested group sizes, role counts and level guidance can be adjusted before creating the event. Roles are chosen by members.</p></form></details><div id="event-templates"></div><details id="event-history" class="settings-disclosure event-archive" hidden><summary>Event history <span id="event-history-count"></span></summary><div id="event-history-list" class="hall-list"></div></details></div></div>
      <div id="hall-people" class="hall-pane" hidden><div class="hall-layout"><div><h3>The people behind the characters</h3><p class="subtle">Main/alt links and biographies are visible only to signed-in guild members.</p><div id="member-directory" class="hall-list"></div></div><div><form id="main-form" class="panel hall-form"><h3>Your main &amp; alts</h3><label>Display as your main<select name="character_id" id="main-character" class="owned-characters"></select></label><fieldset id="alt-choices"><legend>Group these alts under your main</legend><div id="alt-options"></div></fieldset><p class="subtle">Only characters verified on your Battle.net account can be selected. Unchecked characters stay separate.</p><button class="button primary" type="submit">Save main &amp; alts</button></form><form id="role-form" class="panel hall-form"><h3>Your character roles</h3><label>Character<select name="character_id" id="role-character" class="owned-characters" required></select></label><p class="subtle" id="role-help">Select every role you enjoy playing, then choose one as your primary. You can change these choices at any time. These are your preferences, separate from event sign-ups.</p><fieldset class="role-options" aria-describedby="role-help"><legend>Preferred roles and primary choice</legend><div id="role-options"></div></fieldset><p id="role-feedback" class="subtle" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div class="role-form-actions"><button class="button primary" type="submit">Save role preferences</button><button class="button secondary" id="clear-roles" type="button">Clear choices</button></div></form><details class="settings-disclosure"><summary>Discord notifications</summary><article class="panel hall-form"><h3>{{BOT_NAME}} on Discord</h3><p id="discord-member-status" class="subtle">Checking the guild bot…</p><a id="discord-link" class="button" href="/auth/discord/login" hidden>Authorise {{BOT_NAME}}</a><form id="discord-preferences" hidden><label class="alt-choice"><input name="requester_dm" type="checkbox">DM me about my crafting requests</label><label class="alt-choice"><input name="crafter_dm" type="checkbox">DM me when a guild member requests a recipe I know</label><button class="button primary" type="submit">Save notification choices</button><button id="discord-unlink" class="button" type="button">Remove {{BOT_NAME}} authorisation</button></form><p class="subtle">Your existing WoW ↔ Discord connection stays in place. {{BOT_NAME}} cannot read that private game link. Authorise {{BOT_NAME}} here to match your verified character, or ask a guild administrator to add a mapping for you. Matched reactions appear in the same event sign-up list. Website access still requires Battle.net verification. Crafting DMs require permission and Discord allowing messages from the bot.</p></article></details><details class="settings-disclosure"><summary>Roleplay profile</summary><form id="rp-form" class="panel hall-form"><h3>Your roleplay profile</h3><label>Character<select name="character_id" id="rp-character" class="owned-characters"></select></label><label>Title or guild role<input name="title" maxlength="80" placeholder="Apprentice alchemist"></label><label>Biography<textarea name="biography" maxlength="1500" rows="6" placeholder="Tell the guild a little about your character"></textarea></label><label>Looking for<textarea name="looking_for" maxlength="300" rows="2" placeholder="Adventures, stories, or a crafting partner"></textarea></label><button class="button primary" type="submit">Save profile</button></form></details></div></div></div>
    </div><datalist id="known-recipes"></datalist>
  </section>
  <section id="adventures" class="tab-panel" hidden><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow gold">LEAVE NO ADVENTURER BEHIND</div><h2>Quest board</h2></div></div><article class="panel status-card"><h3>What this board can show</h3><p>Live online status and current area are unavailable from the verified Blizzard API. Characters remain <strong>unknown</strong>; recent profile updates do not establish presence.</p></article><div id="quest-gate" class="panel empty"><p>Sign in as a verified guild member to compare quest logs.</p><a class="button battlenet" href="/auth/login">Sign in with Battle.net</a></div><div id="quest-member" hidden><form id="quest-form" class="panel hall-form"><h3>Compare your party’s quests</h3><label>Area to check<select id="quest-area" required><option value="">Loading areas…</option></select></label><fieldset><legend>Choose up to five guild characters</legend><div id="quest-characters" class="quest-choices"></div></fieldset><label class="alt-choice"><input id="quest-shared-only" type="checkbox" checked>Only quests active for at least one chosen character</label><button class="button primary" type="submit">Compare quest logs</button><p class="subtle">Logs are checked on demand and cached for 10 minutes. Choose the area manually. Blizzard’s snapshots can lag behind the game.</p></form><p id="quest-note" class="notice" hidden></p><div id="quest-result" class="panel"></div></div></section>
  <section id="history" class="tab-panel" hidden><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow gold">EVERY ADVENTURE LEAVES A MARK</div><h2>Progress &amp; history</h2></div><select id="history-character" aria-label="Choose a character for progress history"><option value="0">Whole guild</option></select></div><p id="history-note" class="subtle">History starts with this tracker. Times show observations rather than exact in-game actions.</p><div class="status-grid"><article class="panel status-card"><h3>Recent milestones</h3><div id="activity-list"></div></article><article class="panel status-card"><h3>Character observations</h3><p class="subtle">Each observed level, skill or recipe change has its own dated entry. Identical refreshes are omitted.</p><div id="snapshot-list"><p class="subtle">Choose a character to see their observed levels and profession skills.</p></div></article></div></section>
  <footer><span>{{GUILD_NAME_UPPER}} <span class="muted">· {{REGION_RULESET_UPPER}}</span> · <a href="/privacy.html">About your data</a></span><span id="updated">Waiting for first import</span></footer>
</main>
<dialog id="member-dialog"><button class="dialog-close" aria-label="Close character details">×</button><div id="member-content"></div></dialog>
</body></html>
